Port of rexglue-sdk#501: the POSIX PosixConditionBase::WaitMultiple no longer polls every 1 ms. Waiters sleep on a
global epoch and condition variable that Event::Set, Semaphore::Release, Mutant::Release, Timer::Signal and thread exit
bump after the state change, with a 20 ms fallback cap. Single-handle waits and the Windows backend are unchanged.
Includes the upstream unit tests.

